+ * file, You can obtain one at http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. */
+
+/**
+ * Provider and model catalog for the NullSec AI sidebar.
+ *
+ * The shape mirrors the opencode model picker: providers are grouped into
+ * "Popular" and "Other", may carry a badge, and expose a list of selectable
+ * models. `api` selects the request/response dialect ("openai" compatible or
+ * "anthropic"). `needsKey` marks providers that work without an API key
+ * (local runtimes). `local` marks providers whose traffic never leaves the
+ * machine, which is what keeps a session truly anonymous.
+ */
