 local system. Ensure only authorized keys are allowed access to critical r"}, {"id": "mitre-attack-T1094", "source": "mitre", "title": "T1094 Custom Command and Control Protocol Mitigation", "tags": ["custom command and control protocol mitigation", "mitigation", "t1094"], "summary": "**ATT&CK ID:** T1094 **Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/mitigations/T1094 Properly configure firewalls and proxies to limit outgoing traffic to only necessary ports and through proper network gateway systems. Also ensure hosts are only provisioned to communicate over authorized interfaces. Netw"}, {"id": "mitre-attack-M1036", "source": "mitre", "title": "M1036 Account Use Policies", "tags": ["account use policies", "m1036", "mitigation"], "summary": "**ATT&CK ID:** M1036 **Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/mitigations/M1036 Account Use Policies help mitigate unauthorized access by configuring and enforcing rules that govern how and when accounts can be used. These policies include enforcing account lockout mechanisms, restricting login times"}, {"id": "mitre-attack-T1143", "source": "mitre", "title": "T1143 Hidden Window Mitigation", "tags": ["hidden window mitigation", "mitigation", "t1143"], "summary": "**ATT&CK ID:** T1143 **Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/mitigations/T1143 Whitelist programs that are allowed to have this plist tag. All other programs should be considered suspicious."}, {"id": "mitre-attack-T1031", "source": "mitre", "title": "T1031 Modify Existing Service Mitigation", "tags": ["mitigation", "modify existing service mitigation", "t1031"], "summary": "**ATT&CK ID:** T1031 **Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/mitigations/T1031 Use auditing tools capable of detecting privilege and service abuse opportunities on systems within an enterprise and correct them. Limit privileges of user accounts and groups so that only authorized administrators can i"}, {"id": "mitre-attack-M1041", "source": "mitre", "title": "M1041 Encrypt Sensitive Information", "tags":