p links_ are URIs of any scheme that take users directly to specific content in an app. An app can [set up deep links](ht"}, {"id": "owasp-mastg-mastg-know-0020", "source": "owasp", "title": "OWASP MASTG Knowledge: MASTG KNOW 0020", "tags": ["knowledge", "mastg", "mastg know 0020", "mobile", "owasp"], "summary": "--- masvs_category: MASVS-PLATFORM platform: android title: Inter-Process Communication (IPC) Mechanisms --- Every Android process runs in its own sandboxed address space. [Inter-process communication"}, {"id": "owasp-mastg-mastg-know-0021", "source": "owasp", "title": "OWASP MASTG Knowledge: MASTG KNOW 0021", "tags": ["knowledge", "mastg", "mastg know 0021", "mobile", "owasp"], "summary": "--- masvs_category: MASVS-PLATFORM platform: android title: Object Serialization --- There are several ways to serialize an object on Android: ## Java Serializable API An object and its data can be re"}, {"id": "owasp-mastg-mastg-know-0022", "source": "owasp", "title": "OWASP MASTG Knowledge: MASTG KNOW 0022", "tags": ["knowledge", "mastg", "mastg know 0022", "mobile", "owasp"], "summary": "--- masvs_category: MASVS-PLATFORM platform: android title: Overlay Attacks --- Screen overlay attacks occur when a malicious application places itself on top of another application which continues to"}, {"id": "owasp-mastg-mastg-know-0023", "source": "owasp", "title": "OWASP MASTG Knowledge: MASTG KNOW 0023", "tags": ["knowledge", "mastg", "mastg know 0023", "mobile", "owasp"], "summary": "--- masvs_category: MASVS-PLATFORM platform: android title: Enforced Updating --- Forcing a user to update the application can be necessary in multiple cases: - A client-side vulnerability was discove"}, {"id": "owasp-mastg-mastg-know-0024", "source": "owasp", "title": "OWASP MASTG Knowledge: MASTG KNOW 0024", "tags": ["knowledge", "mastg", "mastg know 0024", "mobile", "owasp"], "summary": "--- masvs_category: MASVS-PLATFORM platform: android title: Pending Intents --- Often while dealing with comp